=== ESM-2 (35M) DELTA-LLR BIOLOGICAL DIRECTION CORRELATION AUDIT ===
Delta-LLR Definition: log P(mut | x_{\i}) - log P(wt | x_{\i})
Hypothesis 1: Negative correlation (Delta-LLR < 0, deleterious -> resistant)
Hypothesis 2: Positive correlation (Delta-LLR > 0, stabilizing/fit -> resistant)

=== UL23-Aciclovir (N=286: 120 Resistant, 166 Sensitive) ===
  Mean Delta-LLR Sensitive: -0.4979 +/- 1.1492
  Mean Delta-LLR Resistant: -1.7110 +/- 2.3423
  Spearman rho:             -0.2804 (p = 1.4522e-06)
  Kendall tau:              -0.2293 (p = 2.2101e-06)
  Point-Biserial r:         -0.3234 (p = 2.1932e-08)
  Mann-Whitney U (Res<Sens): p = 1.1090e-06
  AUROC (Raw Delta-LLR):    0.3360
  AUROC (-Delta-LLR):       0.6640
  Direction Verdict:        Consistently Deleterious -> Resistant (Negative Correlation)

